15:[["$","section",null,{"id":"summary","aria-labelledby":"summary-heading","className":"grid gap-4 border-t py-12 md:grid-cols-[10rem_1fr] md:gap-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"id":"summary-heading","className":"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground md:pt-1","children":"Summary"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"min-w-0","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"text-pretty leading-relaxed","children":"Frontend-focused software engineer building production web applications, most recently AI-native interfaces: an in-platform LLM-powered app builder with streaming chat, agent clarifying-question flows, and live previews of generated apps. Comfortable across the spectrum, from extending a large legacy frontend platform to owning greenfield features across the stack. Former philosophy PhD and university instructor who brings rigorous analytical thinking and clear written communication to engineering work."}]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"id":"experience","aria-labelledby":"experience-heading","className":"grid gap-4 border-t py-12 md:grid-cols-[10rem_1fr] md:gap-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"id":"experience-heading","className":"font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground md:pt-1","children":"Experience"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"min-w-0","children":["$","ol",null,{"className":"flex flex-col gap-8","children":[["$","li","Software Engineer-Annalect (Omnicom)",{"className":"grid gap-1 md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] md:gap-x-6 print:break-inside-avoid","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"min-w-0 text-lg font-medium tracking-tight","children":["Software Engineer",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-muted-foreground","children":[", ","Annalect (Omnicom)"]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"font-mono text-xs text-muted-foreground md:max-w-48 md:row-start-1 md:col-start-2 md:pt-1.5 md:text-right","children":["May 2023–Present",[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":"true","children":" · "}],"New York, NY (Remote)"]]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"flex list-disc flex-col gap-1 pt-2 pl-5 leading-relaxed marker:text-muted-foreground md:col-span-2","children":[["$","li","Frontend engineer on an AI app builder that lets non-technical users generate and deploy custom web apps through chat with an LLM agent; built the human-in-the-loop flow that lets the agent pause and ask users clarifying questions, and contributed to the streaming chat UX and template/tutorial onboarding.",{"className":"text-pretty","children":"Frontend engineer on an AI app builder that lets non-technical users generate and deploy custom web apps through chat with an LLM agent; built the human-in-the-loop flow that lets the agent pause and ask users clarifying questions, and contributed to the streaming chat UX and template/tutorial onboarding."}],["$","li","Led the frontend side of hardening the app builder’s untested prototype for production: broke up its monolithic generation logic and main chat view across six small, independently reviewable PRs and raised frontend unit test coverage from 0% to over 75%, all without pausing feature delivery.",{"className":"text-pretty","children":"Led the frontend side of hardening the app builder’s untested prototype for production: broke up its monolithic generation logic and main chat view across six small, independently reviewable PRs and raised frontend unit test coverage from 0% to over 75%, all without pausing feature delivery."}],["$","li","Led a greenfield Q&A platform (“Ask the Collective”): built the full frontend (rich-text editor, replies, filter/sort, sharing, permissions) and extended its Python/FastAPI backend.",{"className":"text-pretty","children":"Led a greenfield Q&A platform (“Ask the Collective”): built the full frontend (rich-text editor, replies, filter/sort, sharing, permissions) and extended its Python/FastAPI backend."}],"$L24","$L25","$L26"]}]]}],"$L27"]}]}]]}],"$L28","$L29","$L2a"]
