24:["$","li","Designed and built the platform’s email notification system: AWS SES setup and domain verification, backend trigger logic, subscribe/unsubscribe, and one-click unsubscribe. Diagnosed and fixed an intermittent production delivery failure that couldn’t be reproduced locally.",{"className":"text-pretty","children":"Designed and built the platform’s email notification system: AWS SES setup and domain verification, backend trigger logic, subscribe/unsubscribe, and one-click unsubscribe. Diagnosed and fixed an intermittent production delivery failure that couldn’t be reproduced locally."}]
25:["$","li","Extended the platform’s cross-frame messaging library (postMessage API) so embedded micro-frontend apps sync their routes to the parent URL, making deep links, bookmarks, and back-button navigation work for iframed apps for the first time.",{"className":"text-pretty","children":"Extended the platform’s cross-frame messaging library (postMessage API) so embedded micro-frontend apps sync their routes to the parent URL, making deep links, bookmarks, and back-button navigation work for iframed apps for the first time."}]
26:["$","li","Designed a configurable, responsive carousel web component in Lit (navigation modes, cards per view, arbitrary slotted content) that was adopted across the platform, and led frontend work on the configurable homepage content block it anchors.",{"className":"text-pretty","children":"Designed a configurable, responsive carousel web component in Lit (navigation modes, cards per view, arbitrary slotted content) that was adopted across the platform, and led frontend work on the configurable homepage content block it anchors."}]
